  "exercise_count": 15,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们讨论怎样把$x^3$的五次方写成底数$x$的幂的形式．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_text": "我们讨论怎样把$x^3$的五次方写成底数$x$的幂的形式．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据幂的定义，$(x^3)^5$是五个相同因数$x^3$的积，即$(x^3)^5=x^3\\cdot x^3\\cdot x^3\\cdot x^3\\cdot x^3$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_text": "根据幂的定义，$(x^3)^5$是五个相同因数$x^3$的积，即$(x^3)^5=x^3\\cdot x^3\\cdot x^3\\cdot x^3\\cdot x^3$．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "应用幂的基本性质，得$x^3\\cdot x^3\\cdot x^3\\cdot x^3\\cdot x^3=x^{3+3+3+3+3}=x^{3\\cdot5}$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_text": "应用幂的基本性质，得$x^3\\cdot x^3\\cdot x^3\\cdot x^3\\cdot x^3=x^{3+3+3+3+3}=x^{3\\cdot5}$．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此，$(x^3)^5=x^{3\\cdot5}$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_text": "因此，$(x^3)^5=x^{3\\cdot5}$．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "一般地，幂的底数$a$是一个任意数，而$m$和$n$是任意的自然数，那么下列等式是真等式：\n$(a^m)^n=a^{mn}$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_text": "一般地，幂的底数$a$是一个任意数，而$m$和$n$是任意的自然数，那么下列等式是真等式：$(a^m)^n=a^{mn}$．",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "幂乘方时，底数不变，而指数相乘．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_text": "幂乘方时，底数不变，而指数相乘．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "要注意的是，负数的偶次幂是正数，负数的奇次幂是负数．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_text": "要注意的是，负数的偶次幂是正数，负数的奇次幂是负数．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "从下面的例子很容易看出这一点：\n$(-2)^{10}=((-2)^2)^5=4^5=1024$，\n$(-3)^7=(-3)^6\\cdot(-3)=729\\cdot(-3)=-2187$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 158,
      "source_text": "从下面的例子很容易看出这一点：$(-2)^{10}=((-2)^2)^5=4^5=1024$，$(-3)^7=(-3)^6\\cdot(-3)=729\\cdot(-3)=-2187$．",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": []
    }
  ],
